// consoleZHBlock maps the inner markup of a <p> to Chinese; used for prose with inline markup.
var consoleZHBlock = map[string]string{
	"<code>tailscale serve</code> runs on the device. It needs the\n<code>https</code> node attribute from the policy, and a certificate: this\ncontrol plane proxies ACME DNS-01 challenges to the configured DNS provider,\nso the device must be able to obtain one of the names below. Nothing here is\nchanged from this page.": "<code>tailscale serve</code> 在设备上运行。它需要策略中的 <code>https</code> 节点属性以及一张证书：本控制面把 ACME DNS-01 挑战代理到已配置的 DNS 提供商，因此设备必须能获得下列名称之一。本页不会做任何修改。",
	"<span class=\"warn\">disabled</span> — the chain is kept, so a node that still\nenforces tailnet lock locally can fetch the disablement secret and clear its\nstate. Node keys are no longer verified by peers.":                                                                                                                "<span class=\"warn\">已停用</span> —— 链条保留，仍然在本地强制网络锁的节点可以取回停用密钥并清除自身状态。节点密钥不再由对端校验。",
	"A Tailscale SSH connection is waiting for a decision. Approving lets it\nproceed; the decision is recorded in the audit log.":                                                                                                                                                                                                   "一条 Tailscale SSH 连接正在等待决定：批准后即可继续，决定会记入审计日志。",
	"A device is asking to join the tailnet. Approving authorizes the machine keys\nbelow; it does not make the device a human identity.":                                                                                                                                                                                            "Xunara 注册了本机密钥；审批只授权下面的机器密钥，不会把设备变成用户身份。",
	"A grant authorizes allocation; a target that does not offer a\nrelay, or is disabled by policy, is a configuration mismatch to fix.":                                                                                                                                                                                            "授权决定是否可以分配；目标节点没有提供中继、或被策略禁用，都属于需要修复的配置不一致。",
	"A relay grant is a <code>grants</code> row whose <code>app</code> map\ncarries <code>tailscale.com/cap/relay</code>, for example\n<code>{\"src\": [\"group:dev\"], \"dst\": [\"tag:relay\"],\n\"app\": {\"tailscale.com/cap/relay\": []}}</code>. Nothing is authorized\nuntil such a row exists.":                              "中继授权是一条 <code>grants</code> 记录，其 <code>app</code> 映射携带 <code>tailscale.com/cap/relay</code>，例如 <code>{\"src\": [\"group:dev\"], \"dst\": [\"tag:relay\"], \"app\": {\"tailscale.com/cap/relay\": []}}</code>。只有存在这样一条记录，才会真正授权。",
	"A snapshot of this tailnet's security posture, derived from the state the\nother management surfaces already own. There is deliberately no score and no\nlive monitoring: findings are deterministic observations (spec section 39).":                                                                                           "本网络的安全态势快照，取自其它管理界面已经掌握的状态。这里刻意不做评分，也不做实时监控：所有发现都是确定性的观察结果（规范 §39）。",
	"An exit node is a machine approved to route the tailnet's default routes.\nNodes choose one locally (<code>tailscale up --exit-node=…</code>), and the\nclient reports that choice to the control plane; this page joins the two\nhalves. Approval and withdrawal live on the Machines page.":                                   "出口节点是被批准转发默认路由的设备。节点在本机选择（<code>tailscale up --exit-node=…</code>），客户端把选择上报控制面；本页把两半合在一起。批准与撤销在「设备」页面完成。",
	"Approving a device authorizes the machine keys below; it does not make the\ndevice a human identity.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "批准设备即授权下面的机器密钥，但不会把设备变成用户身份。",
	"Audit events are POSTed to these receivers. The signing secret is stored\nsealed and is never shown again after creation.":                                                                                                                                                                                                      "审计事件会 POST 到这些接收方。签名密钥密封存储，创建后不再显示。",
	"Choose an identity provider to continue.": "选择身份提供方以继续。",
	"Every node that reported an exit-node selection. A selection that no longer\nnames an approved exit node stays listed as unresolved: approving or restoring\nthe node makes it effective again.": "所有上报过出口节点选择的节点。若选择指向的出口节点不再被批准，会显示为未解析：重新批准或恢复该节点即可生效。",
	"Every node whose key expiry is set, soonest first. Expired and expiring\nkeys are the actionable subset; the rest is the schedule.":                                                              "所有设置了密钥有效期的节点，最早到期在前。已过期与即将过期的密钥是可操作的部分，其余只是排期。",
	"Extra records served to clients alongside MagicDNS.":                        "除 MagicDNS 之外，额外下发给客户端的解析记录。",
	"Flux is not enabled on this deployment, so there are no transfers to show.": "本部署未启用 Flux，因此没有可显示的传输记录。",
	"Flux is not enabled on this deployment, so there are no transfers to show.\nAn operator enables it with <code>-flux</code> (single organization) or\n<code>flux_enabled</code> (organization table).":                                                                                               "本部署未启用 Flux，因此没有可显示的传输记录。",
	"Funnel: <span class=\"tag warn\">not supported</span>. Funnel needs public\ningress infrastructure this build does not run; the policy loader rejects the\n<code>funnel</code> attribute outright, and a device that still reports Funnel\nendpoints enabled is shown below as a misconfiguration.": "Funnel：<span class=\"tag warn\">不支持</span>。Funnel 需要本版本不运行的公网入口基础设施；策略加载器会直接拒绝 <code>funnel</code> 属性，仍然上报启用 Funnel 端点的设备会在下方标记为配置错误。",
	"No ACL rules in the document.": "文档中没有 ACL 规则。",
	"No API keys yet.":              "暂无 API 密钥。",
	"No DERP map is configured, so clients keep their built-in default regions\nuntil one is.": "尚未配置 DERP 地图，客户端继续使用内置默认区域。",
	"No Flux transfer has that ID.": "没有该 ID 的文件投递。",
	"No Flux transfers match.":      "没有匹配的文件投递。",
	"No Reach session has that ID.": "没有该 ID 的远程命令会话。",
	"No Reach sessions match.":      "没有匹配的远程命令会话。",
	"No SSH checks match.":          "没有匹配的 SSH 审批。",
	"No SSH rules in the document.": "文档中没有 SSH 规则。",
	"No agent credentials. A device creates one when it enrolls with\n<code>/api/agent/v1/enroll</code>.": "暂无 Agent 凭据。设备通过 <code>/api/agent/v1/enroll</code> 注册时会自动创建。",
	"No audit events yet.": "暂无审计事件。",
	"No auth keys.":        "暂无预认证密钥。",
	"No device is authorized to serve, and none reported Funnel or ingress\nactivity. Grant <code>https</code> in the policy's <code>nodeAttrs</code> to\nenable <code>tailscale serve</code> on a device.": "暂无设备被授权对外提供服务，也没有上报 Funnel 或入口活动。在策略的 <code>nodeAttrs</code> 中授予 <code>funnel</code> 即可为设备启用 <code>tailscale serve</code>。",
	"No devices are waiting for approval.":                          "暂无等待审批的设备。",
	"No extra DNS records.":                                         "暂无额外 DNS 记录。",
	"No findings: the posture matches the configured expectations.": "没有发现风险：安全态势符合配置预期。",
	"No grants in the document.":                                    "文档中没有 grant 授权。",
	"No groups defined.":                                            "未定义分组。",
	"No hosts defined.":                                             "未定义主机。",
	"No machine is approved as an exit node. Approve the default route on the\nMachines page after the node advertises <code>0.0.0.0/0</code> and/or\n<code>::/0</code>.": "暂无设备被批准为出口节点。请在节点发布 <code>0.0.0.0/0</code> 和/或 <code>::/0</code> 之后到「设备」页面批准默认路由。",
	"No machines are shared with your identities.": "没有共享给您身份的设备。",
	"No machines shared with other organizations.": "没有共享给其它组织的设备。",
	"No machines yet.":                   "暂无设备。",
	"No node has selected an exit node.": "暂无节点选择出口节点。",
	"No node keys expire; every node is registered without a key expiry.": "没有节点密钥会过期；所有节点都注册为密钥永不过期。",
	"No node offers to relay. A node opts in with\n<code>tailscale set --relay-server-port=&lt;port&gt;</code>; its willingness then\nappears here, and a relay grant decides who may use it.": "暂无节点提供中继。节点通过 <code>tailscale set --relay-server-port=…</code> 主动加入；加入后会显示在此处，再由中继授权决定谁可以使用。",
	"No nodeAttrs in the document.":           "文档中没有 nodeAttrs。",
	"No passkeys registered on this account.": "此账号尚未注册通行密钥。",
	"No policy document is configured: every machine may reach every other\nmachine, the same behaviour as an official tailnet without a policy.": "未配置策略文档：每台设备都可以访问其它设备，与没有策略的官方 tailnet 行为一致。",
	"No regions are served: the policy tells clients this organization has no\nDERP at all.":                                                      "未提供任何区域：策略告知客户端本组织没有 DERP。",
	"No services have been advertised. An agent publishes them with\n<code>xunara-agent</code> / <code>/api/agent/v1/services</code>.":            "暂无发布的服务。agent 通过 <code>xunara-agent</code> / <code>/api/agent/v1/services</code> 发布。",
	"No stderr output.":                    "无错误输出。",
	"No stdout output.":                    "无标准输出。",
	"No tag owners defined.":               "未定义标签所有者。",
	"No webhook receivers are configured.": "尚未配置回调接收方。",
	"Not enabled. Node keys are not verified by peers; an administrator turns it on\nwith <code>tailscale lock init</code> from a trusted machine.":                                                     "未启用。节点密钥不由对端校验；管理员可在受信任的机器上执行 <code>tailscale lock init</code> 开启。",
	"Not enabled: this deployment has no externally reachable <code>-server-url</code>,\nso it has no issuer URL to be a trust anchor for, and nodes receive 501 from\n<code>/machine/id-token</code>.": "未启用：本部署没有可外部访问的 <code>-server-url</code>，因此没有可作为信任锚的 issuer URL，节点从 <code>/machine/id-token</code> 收到 501。",
	"Passkey sign-in is not configured on this server.": "本服务器未配置通行密钥登录。",
	"Passkeys sign you in without a password and never authorize a machine. The\nprivate key stays on your device; the server stores only its public key.": "通行密钥让您免密登录，且从不用来授权设备：私钥只保存在您的设备上，服务器只存储公钥。",
	"Peer relays are an underlay mesh extension: a node with\n<code>tailscale set --relay-server-port=…</code> offers to relay UDP traffic\nfor other nodes, and an ACL grant carrying\n<code>tailscale.com/cap/relay</code> authorizes which nodes may allocate relay\nendpoints from it. Clients fall back to a relay only when direct connectivity\nand DERP are not good enough; the control plane never selects one.": "对等中继是底层网格的扩展：带 <code>tailscale.com/cap/relay</code> 能力的节点可以为其它节点中转 UDP 流量，携带 <code>disable-relay-client</code>/<code>disable-relay-server</code> 的 ACL grant 决定谁可以使用它。只有在直连和 DERP 都不理想时客户端才会回退到中继；控制面从不主动选择中继。",
	"Pre-authentication keys let a machine register without a browser. The secret\nis shown once, at creation time, and never again.":                                                 "预认证密钥让设备无需浏览器即可注册。密钥只在创建时显示一次，之后不再显示。",
	"Provider and subject identify the recipient (for example an OIDC issuer and\nits <code>sub</code>); email addresses are attributes, never identity keys.":                        "提供商与主体（subject）共同标识接收方（例如某个 OIDC issuer 及其 <code>sub</code>）；邮箱只是属性，绝不是身份键。",
	"Reach is not enabled on this deployment, so no sessions can exist. An\noperator enables it per organization (<code>reach_enabled</code>) and runs\n<code>xunarad -reach</code>.": "本部署未启用 Reach，因此不会存在会话。运维按组织启用（<code>reach_enabled</code>）并使用 <code>xunarad -reach</code> 运行。",
	"Reach is not enabled on this deployment, so there are no sessions to show.":                                                                                                      "本部署未启用 Reach，因此没有可显示的会话。",
	"Read-only view (Xunara Warden) of the ACL document in force. It is loaded\nfrom disk and reloaded when the file changes; there is no editor here.":                               "当前生效 ACL 文档的只读视图（Xunara Warden）。文档从磁盘加载，文件变化时自动重载；此处不提供编辑器。",
	"Service identity credentials for automation: the <code>xunara_…</code> tokens\n<code>/api/v1</code> and <code>/api/v2</code> accept. A key carries the scopes\nit was granted, but never more than its owner's role allows; only the token's\nhash is stored, and this page never shows it again. OAuth/OIDC login providers\nare server configuration and are not managed here.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          "面向自动化的服务身份凭据：<code>/api/v1</code> 与 <code>/api/v2</code> 接受 <code>xunara_…</code> 令牌。密钥携带被授予的权限范围，但不会超过其所有者角色的上限；服务器只保存令牌哈希，本页不会再次显示。OAuth/OIDC 登录提供方属于服务器配置，不在此管理。",
	"Services nodes advertise about themselves. Publishing happens on the node\n(<code>/api/agent/v1/services</code>); this page is read-only. A service name\nresolves in MagicDNS to the advertising node, and reachability is still decided\nby the ACL rules — discovery is not authorization. Services with health\nreporting enabled are withdrawn from MagicDNS while they are unhealthy, and\n<em>visibility</em> narrows which nodes can resolve the name (<code>*</code> is\nthe whole organization). <em>Shared</em> services are also projected into the\norganizations that accepted a share of the advertising machine, under\n<code>&lt;name&gt;-&lt;org&gt;</code> (discovery only: the ACL rules of both\norganizations still decide who may connect). A service whose\n<em>visibility</em> comes <em>from the ACL</em> is discoverable exactly by the\nnodes that may already connect to it.": "服务由节点自行发布（使用 <code>/api/agent/v1/services</code>），本页只读。服务名会通过 MagicDNS 解析到发布节点；能否连接仍由 ACL 规则决定——可发现不等于已授权。启用健康检查的服务在不健康期间会从 MagicDNS 中撤下；<em>可见性</em>决定哪些节点可以解析该名称（<code>*</code> 表示整个组织）。<em>已共享</em>的服务也会投射到接受该机器共享的组织，名称形如 <code>&lt;name&gt;-&lt;org&gt;</code>（仅用于发现：仍需双方组织的 ACL 规则允许才能连接）。<em>可见性</em>来自 <em>ACL</em> 的服务，只有本来就能连接它的节点可以发现。",
	"Sharing a machine gives one identity in another organization a synthetic\nview of that machine: addresses, node IDs and tags are never exchanged, and\nonly the receiving user's nodes see it (PROJECT_SPEC section 38.4). Sharing is\nunavailable while either organization enforces tailnet lock.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       "共享一台设备会向另一个组织中的某个身份提供该设备的合成视图：地址、节点 ID 与标签都不会交换，只有接收方的节点能看到它（规范 §38.4）。任一组织启用网络锁时都无法共享。",
	"Sharing is not enabled on this deployment. Cross-organization shares live\nin a platform-level registry, so they are available only when the server runs\nwith <code>-platform-state-dir</code> and a router hosts both organizations in\nthis process (PROJECT_SPEC section 38.2).":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       "本部署未启用共享。跨组织共享存放在平台级注册表中，因此只有服务器以 <code>-platform-state-dir</code> 运行、并且一个 router 在本进程内承载两个组织时才能使用（规范 §38.2）。",
	"Tailscale SSH \"check\" mode: connections held until a human decides. This\npage is read-only. A verdict is handed to exactly one follow-up request, so\n\"consumed\" means the connection that asked for it already took the verdict;\n\"expired\" is a pending check whose TTL passed before the janitor removed it.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    "Tailscale SSH 的 \"check\" 模式：连接会一直挂起，直到有人做出决定。本页只读。结论只会交给一个后续请求，因此「已消费」表示发起检查的连接已经取走结论；「已过期」表示在后台清理之前 TTL 已过的待处理检查。",
	"The file itself is end-to-end encrypted between the two agents: the control\nplane stores only ciphertext while a transfer is in flight, deletes it when\nthe transfer completes or fails, and no console page can show the content.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      "文件本身在两个 agent 之间端到端加密：传输过程中控制面只保存密文，完成或失败后立即删除，任何控制台页面都无法查看内容。",
	"The most recent events first, at most 200.": "最近的事件在前，最多 200 条。",
	"The output is retained with the session (one hour after the last update)\nand may contain sensitive data; it never enters the audit log.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                     "输出随会话保留（最后一次更新后一小时），可能包含敏感数据；它不会写入审计日志。",
	"These top-level fields are understood but not enforced by this build;\nignoring them can only tighten the policy, never widen it.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                            "这些顶层字段可以被解析，但当前版本不会执行它们；忽略它们只会收紧策略，绝不会放宽。",
	"Which DERP regions this organization serves its clients, and where the\nmachines are homed. The policy comes from the deployment's\n<code>-derp-policy</code> / organization table; this page is read-only.\nServing a filtered map is advisory - the admission controller is the\nenforceable half, and it only covers the relay Xunara runs.":               "本组织向客户端提供哪些 DERP 区域，以及设备归属的区域。策略来自部署的 <code>-derp-policy</code> / 组织表；本页只读。下发筛选后的地图只是建议——准入控制器才是强制执行的一半，并且只覆盖 Xunara 自己运行的中继。",
	"Xunara Agent credentials (native clients). Revoking one signs that agent out\nimmediately; the device keeps its node identity and can enroll again.":                                                                                                                                                                                                          "Xunara Agent 凭据（原生客户端使用）。吊销后该 agent 立即退出登录；设备保留节点身份，可以重新注册。",
	"Xunara Flux file transfers between agents. The control plane relays\nciphertext only: file content and keys are end-to-end encrypted and are not\nvisible here or anywhere else on the server. The recipient must accept a\ntransfer before anything is uploaded; this page is read-only.":                                                                    "Xunara Flux 在两个 agent 之间传输文件。控制面只中转密文：文件内容与密钥端到端加密，在服务器上任何位置都不可见。接收方接受之后才会开始上传；本页只读。",
	"Xunara Reach sessions between nodes: who offered which command to which\nnode, how it ended, and how much output it produced. A command runs on the\ntarget only after that node approves the offer, and only the two participants\ncan drive a session; this page is read-only. The audit log records the\ndecisions, never the command line or the output.": "Xunara Reach 连接两个节点：谁向谁发起了哪条命令、结果如何、产生了多少输出。只有目标节点批准之后命令才会执行，且只有双方可以推进会话；本页只读。审计日志只记录决定，绝不记录命令行或输出内容。",
	"Your role is read-only; ask an admin or owner to approve this device.":    "你的角色为只读，请联系管理员或所有者审批该设备。",
	"Your role is read-only; ask an admin or owner to decide this connection.": "你的角色为只读，请联系管理员或所有者决定该连接。",
}

// consoleZHPrefix maps a leading fragment to Chinese; the rest of the string is kept, which covers sentences built around runtime values.
var consoleZHPrefix = map[string]string{
	"The last good document is still enforced. Fix the file:": "上一份可用文档仍在生效。请修复文件：",
}
